        "body": "When the deepest accepting container is a graph interior, create a graph-owned instance with a new graph-local record ID, a new semantic nodeId, and the drop position. Repeated drops create multiple independent nodes. Resolve semantic type, class defaults, representation, authority, and shared source provenance from the capability.",
        "priority": "high",
