          "Blank graph space creates a node rather than a graph or declaration.",
          "Every drop allocates a distinct graph-local record ID and a distinct semantic nodeId.",
          "Dropping the same capability three times produces three independently editable instances.",
          "Each instance records instanceOf or class binding plus source graph, node, port, capability, and workspace-instance provenance.",
          "The source graph remains unchanged and each transaction is independently undoable."
        ],
