      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "body": "Resolved provisionally: source grants are orthogonal semantic permissions. The receiving container separately supplies mutation authority. An operation is allowed only when the source offers its grant, the target accepts the capability, and the target permits the required mutation.",
        "status": "answered",
        "owner": "",
        "resolutionPath": "Use navigate, consume-view, reference, instantiate, declare, connect, and invoke as independent source grants. Use create-node, create-graph, create-edge, update-node, and delete-node as receiving-container mutation permissions. No grant implies another.",
        "prominence": "high",
        "definitionKey": "open-question",
