        "title": "Migrate system defaults, templates, editors, and public ports",
        "body": "Teach composePort and the property editor to author explicit grants and identity, representation, and relationship policies. Update system declaration/view/port defaults first, then migrate canonical templates and public graphs in bounded batches before retiring hierarchical authority interpretation.",
        "priority": "high",
        "status": "todo",
        "owner": "",
        "estimateHours": "",
        "acceptanceCriteria": [
          "Newly authored ports write the explicit capability contract.",
          "Canonical system defaults and planning templates use explicit grants.",
          "Migration tooling can report and rewrite legacy interfaces without changing their effective behavior.",
          "Hierarchical authority fallback is removed only after repository and runtime compatibility checks pass."
        ],
